  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFC Private Sector TF</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IFC n&#xe4;ringslivsutveckling</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fond f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;d till reformering och utveckling av den Jugoslaviska     n&#xe4;ringslivssektorn. En fond d&#xe4;r minst 75% av st&#xf6;det skall ske via     svenska konsulter eller f&#xf6;retag. Programmet inneh&#xe5;ller konsultst&#xf6;d,   fokuserad utbildning och r&#xe5;dgivning. Fonden avser en f&#xf6;rsta fas som   ber&#xe4;knas p&#xe5;g&#xe5; i c:a 18 m&#xe5;nader.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFC Trust Fund for the reform and development of the FR Yugoslavia    private sector. A fund where a minimum of 75% of the support should   be implemented by Swedish consultants or companies. The proposed      program consists of consultancy support, focussed training and        advice. The first phase has a duration of c:a 18 months.</narrative>
  </description>
